          "stance": "supports",
          "note": "'saul-, sāuel- \"sun\". WP II, 446. (Indo-Iran. variant: sūl-) Skt. cf. (z-gde) sūraḥ, m. id.; Av. cf. hūrō, gs. of hvarə, id.; Oss. cf. xur, Dig. xor, id.; … Gk. helios …; Lat. sol …; Go. sauil, n., OE sōl …'"
        },
        {
          "src": "KLN",
          "where": "Klein 1966, pp. 1468-1469 s.v. 'Sol, n., the sun' (KLN_1966.txt leaf 779)",
          "stance": "supports",
          "note": "'Sol, n., the sun. — L. sol (prob. fr. *sāwel-, through *sāwol-, *swōl-), cogn. with OI. sūryaḥ, sūraḥ, Avestic hvarə (with r for l) … All these words derive fr. I.-E. base *sāwel-, *sūl-, which are -l-enlargements of base *sāu-, *su-, \"to shine; sun\".'"
        }
      ],
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "lang": "Avestan",
          "words": "hvare, xvar 1",
